From: OpenRAL Contributors <contact@openral.dev>
Subject: [PATCH] openarm_v2.0: forward left/right_can_interface args to the ros2_control macro

Upstream `openarm_v20.urdf.xacro` declares `use_fake_hardware` as a xacro arg but never
declares `left_can_interface` / `right_can_interface`, so `ros2 launch openarm_bringup
openarm.bimanual.launch.py right_can_interface:=... left_can_interface:=...` silently drops
both mappings and `openarm.bimanual.ros2_control.xacro`'s macro falls back to its baked-in
`can0`/`can1` defaults. On any host where the motor buses aren't literally named `can0`/`can1`
(e.g. a USB CAN-FD adapter enumerated as `openarm_left`/`openarm_right`), `OpenArmHW::read()`
still returns `OK` — it has no way to know it's listening on the wrong bus — so `/joint_states`
stays all-zero with no error anywhere in the ROS graph. See
the upstream sources linked below for the full trace.

Verified against the pinned base below and validated on real hardware (Jetson Thor and
Orin, 2026-09-08): with the patch, `right_can_interface:=openarm_right
left_can_interface:=openarm_left` reaches the hardware plugin and `/joint_states` carries
live encoder values; without it the same launch silently binds `can0`/`can1`.
Upstream fix tracked at
https://github.com/enactic/openarm_description — reapply after bumping the pinned SHA in
`deps.repos` until it lands there.

Base: enactic/openarm_description @ 6c7b720f1ba48e8bafa3a3dc752c45f397b42221
Apply from the openarm_description checkout root with:
    git apply --directory=. path/to/0001-openarm-v20-forward-can-interface-args.patch
or:
    patch -p1 < path/to/0001-openarm-v20-forward-can-interface-args.patch

License: the patched file is Apache-2.0 (Enactic, Inc.); this patch is Apache-2.0 too.
---
 assets/robot/openarm_v2.0/urdf/openarm_v20.urdf.xacro | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/assets/robot/openarm_v2.0/urdf/openarm_v20.urdf.xacro b/assets/robot/openarm_v2.0/urdf/openarm_v20.urdf.xacro
index 53fcd40..6b067d3 100644
--- a/assets/robot/openarm_v2.0/urdf/openarm_v20.urdf.xacro
+++ b/assets/robot/openarm_v2.0/urdf/openarm_v20.urdf.xacro
@@ -23,6 +23,8 @@ limitations under the License.
   <xacro:arg name="emit_grasp_frame" default="false" />

   <xacro:arg name="use_fake_hardware" default="true" />
+  <xacro:arg name="left_can_interface" default="can1" />
+  <xacro:arg name="right_can_interface" default="can0" />

   <xacro:property name="robot_root" value="$(find openarm_description)/assets/robot/openarm_v2.0" />
   <xacro:property name="config_root" value="${robot_root + '/config'}" />
@@ -44,6 +46,8 @@ limitations under the License.
     arm_type="v20"
     control_gains="${gains_dict}"
     use_fake_hardware="$(arg use_fake_hardware)"
+    left_can_interface="$(arg left_can_interface)"
+    right_can_interface="$(arg right_can_interface)"
     ee_type="pinch_gripper"
     left_arm_prefix="left_"
     right_arm_prefix="right_"
--
2.34.1
